WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.460
Hi, I'm Monica, the beauty expert.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.960
Hi, I'm Ashley, the coordination maven.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.780
And today we're gonna help one woman

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:08.180
avoid a quarter-life crisis.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.600
I just moved in with my boyfriend,

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.670
and I totally took over his space.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:16.620
(laughing)

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.690
So I've been having some problems sharing.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:23.210
What I'm looking for is some
ways of getting organized

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.740
or learning how to share the space

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.400
to prevent a future fight.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.430
So, I actually wanna
surprise him with this.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.630
A surprise?

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:32.778
He's going away.

00:00:32.778 --> 00:00:33.611
This just got better.

00:00:33.611 --> 00:00:34.700
So I wanna surprise him and be like,

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.476
"Look at our shared space."

00:00:36.476 --> 00:00:37.309
Yeah!

00:00:37.309 --> 00:00:38.142
Yeah, aw,

00:00:38.142 --> 00:00:38.975
he's gonna love that.

00:00:38.975 --> 00:00:41.100
Next steps is we're gonna
get into your place,

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.310
figure out how we can organize.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.143
Let's do it.

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:45.020
I'm ready!

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:46.290
[Ashley] Yes, yeah!

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:50.976
The closet and bathroom
have gotten a little messy.

00:00:50.976 --> 00:00:53.570
My stuff currently is just
sort of in a little corner,

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.400
and yours is sort of everywhere else.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.540
Maybe a little bit more
organization wouldn't hurt.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:00.460
Would be good.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.503
Is there any particular
reason you're asking me this

00:01:02.503 --> 00:01:05.169
and making me hold this camera?

00:01:05.169 --> 00:01:06.278
Nope.

00:01:06.278 --> 00:01:07.278
Hi!

00:01:07.278 --> 00:01:08.111
Hello!

00:01:09.657 --> 00:01:10.876
Thanks for having us.

00:01:10.876 --> 00:01:11.900
Welcome to my house.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:14.990
Yes, we gotta investigate
your bathroom situation.

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.370
As you can see, everything
is just everywhere.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:20.640
What do you feel when you
see all this stuff out?

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:23.010
Does it bother you at all, or
do you just put up with it?

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:24.870
Yeah, no, it really bothers me.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.380
What I want you to try to do

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:28.270
is to streamline your whole routine.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:30.900
I see you have a lot of skin-care stuff.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:33.450
You can consolidate all
of that into one product

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:34.290
that I'm gonna give you.

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:35.123
[Olivia] Ooh.

00:01:35.123 --> 00:01:38.060
It's the Olay Total Effects 7 In One.

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:39.605
So, you don't have to worry about

00:01:39.605 --> 00:01:41.980
moisturizer, SPF, all that stuff.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.960
It's all in one bottle.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:47.690
A great organizing tip is:
sorting like with like;

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:49.280
purging what no longer serves;

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:51.150
and then having a home for everything.

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:53.120
Focus on your stuff for now,

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.060
and then if you come across Jacob's stuff,

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.430
go ahead and move it to the side.

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:58.670
And we want to make
sure he has his section

00:01:58.670 --> 00:01:59.833
and you have yours.

00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:01.500
Yay, you got this.

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:12.880
So I sorted my makeup, and
I purged the obvious things,

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:17.325
and now I'm suppose to purge
the not-so-obvious things.

00:02:17.325 --> 00:02:20.870
But, I think I'm just gonna
put that off 'til tomorrow.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:23.280
Okay, so I'm about the try the product.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:26.390
And it's suppose to moisturize
and firm and brighten.

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:28.690
Oh, and it has SPF,
which is really important

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.770
'cause in LA it's pretty sunny.

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:33.420
Every since I moved from New York,

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.970
my skin has gone crazy,

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:37.760
and my skin products
aren't working anymore.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.680
It's really soft.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:42.360
This is my stuff that was on the floor.

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:44.534
This is all of his clothes
that are on the floor.

00:02:44.534 --> 00:02:46.523
(sigh) I've done enough for today.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:53.994
We watched your vlogs,
and you've done so much.

00:02:53.994 --> 00:02:54.827
Yeah!

00:02:54.827 --> 00:02:55.660
Yeah, good job!

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:57.230
You consolidated your skin-care routine.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:59.210
I haven't seen you work in that closet

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.320
and getting rid of some of those clothes.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:04.660
Yeah, but I feel like
my clothes in my closet

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.850
are representing like
who I was in New York.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:09.360
Organizing that and getting rid of things

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.290
means I'm closing the door -

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:12.570
and that part of my life.

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:15.700
And now I'll just be like who I am in LA,

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.380
and I don't know what that means.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.500
Yeah, it makes it so official, right?

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:22.780
It makes you real; you're
actually claiming this.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:23.613
Right.

00:03:23.613 --> 00:03:24.446
And that can be a little scary,

00:03:24.446 --> 00:03:26.234
but we got you; you got yourself.

00:03:26.234 --> 00:03:27.194
Yay!

00:03:27.194 --> 00:03:28.150
(laughing)

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:29.874
That works with your people.

00:03:29.874 --> 00:03:32.457
(upbeat music)

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:36.700
I'm so tired.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:41.110
I've put it off long enough.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:46.020
It's time to accept the reality
that I live in a sunny place

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:48.930
and that these jackets just gotta go.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:49.953
Jacket number one.

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:54.060
I feel like I can wear
it with pants or a dress.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:56.640
It's giant, and it's hot.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:59.520
I know in my brain that I wear this a ton.

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:01.160
I know that as a person,

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:03.710
like this jacket is more true to me.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:07.030
So I feel like I actually
really do know who I am,

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:08.980
like here in LA, and what I want.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:11.183
So it feels good, and I feel confident.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:16.240
Okay, how do you think
Olivia did with all of this?

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:17.073
It's not easy,

00:04:17.073 --> 00:04:19.460
but I bet you that she's
really pushed herself.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:22.100
Okay, I think it's time
to just dive in and watch.

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:24.727
Let's see what's going on

00:04:24.727 --> 00:04:25.560
[Olivia] Hi!

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:26.393
Hi, I'm home!

00:04:27.327 --> 00:04:28.905
I'm so glad to see you.

00:04:28.905 --> 00:04:31.308
I'm so glad to see you.

00:04:31.308 --> 00:04:32.607
I have a surprise.

00:04:32.607 --> 00:04:33.630
Oh, really?

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:34.570
You're nervous.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:37.240
I'm a little nervous. I don't
know what to expect here.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:40.040
Whoa, we have floor.

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:40.873
He really is surprised.

00:04:40.873 --> 00:04:43.050
Oh my god, look at the room.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.360
This is so nice you
cleaned the entire room.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.923
I didn't just clean the room.

00:04:47.908 --> 00:04:49.200
(classical music)

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:53.220
Oh, hangers!

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:54.330
Half of her stuff is gone.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:55.770
She really purged the jacket.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:59.610
Half of it is your clothes,
and half of it is my clothes.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:02.270
And then these are your clothes organized

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:04.650
from lightest layer to heaviest layer.

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.705
Thank you, this is so nice.

00:05:06.705 --> 00:05:07.755
Aw, he's so impressed.

00:05:07.755 --> 00:05:09.145
I'm tired.

00:05:09.145 --> 00:05:11.270
You don't look tired; you
look like you're glowing.

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:12.185
Yeah.

00:05:12.185 --> 00:05:13.018
Glowing.

00:05:13.018 --> 00:05:13.942
Yeah.

00:05:13.942 --> 00:05:15.133
(giggles)

00:05:15.133 --> 00:05:16.161
Do you want to see more?

00:05:16.161 --> 00:05:17.162
There's more?

00:05:17.162 --> 00:05:17.995
What!

00:05:19.391 --> 00:05:21.974
Oh, my stuff is in the basket.

00:05:23.042 --> 00:05:26.442
Oh my god, your baskets;
it's full of baskets.

00:05:26.442 --> 00:05:28.823
Remember all my skin-care products?

00:05:28.823 --> 00:05:29.897
Yeah, you had a ton.

00:05:29.897 --> 00:05:33.082
I just have one bottle.
Monica gave it to me.

00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:33.915
Who's Monica?

00:05:33.915 --> 00:05:35.490
I'm Monica, thank you very much.

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:36.900
Is this why you've been glowing

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:37.954
since I walked through the door?

00:05:37.954 --> 00:05:38.787
Why I've been glowing?

00:05:38.787 --> 00:05:39.994
Instead of looking really tired.

00:05:39.994 --> 00:05:41.200
(laughing)

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.033
Missed you.

00:05:42.033 --> 00:05:43.940
You did this all when I was gone.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:44.773
Yeah.

00:05:44.773 --> 00:05:45.754
You're so cool.

00:05:45.754 --> 00:05:46.910
Yeah, I am cool.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:48.160
She really did a good job.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.593
One more quarter-life crisis averted.

